{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1789745320000-eb1894", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "10月想出去走访一圈大客户，帮我排个优先级思路。", "id": "813bdb2558014aa2ac9707618b4999ea", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:28:40", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "0e88860896fe40c6a00c200535dad2ee", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:28:40", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "75a1f8faa00541949ebcc6aafb4e094f", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:28:48", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T15:29:30"}, {"type": "text", "text": "**走访优先级三维度**\n1. 回款贡献与账期状态（超期大客户优先当面谈）\n2. 采购趋势（下半年采购额下滑 ≥30% 的必须去）\n3. 战略价值（新产线/扩产意向客户）\n按这三个打分排序，取前 6 家，两周内走完，每次走访带着交付与售后数据去。", "id": "f5f5be04f57e4a2195da460673456957", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:28:48", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T15:29:30"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "422e449912d0478882f6bbd2bd9f0d6a", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:28:48", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-18T15:29:30", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "走访前要准备什么材料？", "id": "14b183a47b944254b4d1dfed6cfa796e", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:31:30", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "324335b77cb54386b5d0f2ad2d263649", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:31:30", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "fd2efaec27ba43a5af495e81a03b0cb6", "created_at": "2026-09-18T15:31:36", "finished_at": "2026-09-18T15:32:10"}, {"type": "text", "text": "三件套：① 该户近12月采购与回款明细；② 我方新产能/新品一页纸；③ 上次售后问题闭环记录。带着数据上门，客户才知道你是来解决问题的。", "id": "0e99891d5